4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=W3heDWXsHPsQ7kNvwFBxYhp&_nc_oc=AdqT570G9bJtZSWPNIrTv-Ir-L5rdKLejLAs1HyEc0fYOwu8WJsoZtAoA9GsSTG6Wz4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8Tj8zApB4d_a7dFvGegCqOK2drHM6BEgG30gz2nT69fw&oe=6A3149D4"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XR66G0QeNDMQ7kNvwEycHs4&_nc_oc=AdohEoUwSPo3DMffqSBbDv_Wt4TOcyWtPM4nez1aa3udYbAqSk_Gq5_JfN0um1tKRF4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9hHaOmzRpBt5QUvWnPKvNc4JjI9pQ-LwOJ-nxUbiaHNQ&oe=6A314EB2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NRxp1UAeUDoQ7kNvwE6fASS&_nc_oc=AdrxKTD08-TmypMwWwNFXEOfDnLHQigSB95GKV8mhxzqoikHSEV9vjwfvrVp120xiq4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8ygEvu8YzqEmGL4uWLvX8AjmmATYeB_6_Mj5rBWB7a_w&oe=6A315C55"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p